<title>USA: Cirrus Logic names Hackworth as chairman.</title>
<headline>Cirrus Logic names Hackworth as chairman.</headline>
<dateline>FREMONT, Calif. 1997-07-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cirrus Logic Inc Wednesday named President and Chief Executive Michael Hackworth as chairman.</p>
<p>Dr. Suhas Patil, who has served as Cirrus Logic's chairman since 1984, will continue as a menber of the board as chairman emeritus and will work closely with Hackworth.</p>
<p>&quot;While it is a natural evolution for me to become chairman, I do so with great thanks to Suhas for serving so well in this position over the past 13 years,&quot; Hackworth said in a statement.</p>
</text>
